\operatorname{TotalOrder}(S, \leq)
\;\coloneqq\;
\operatorname{PartialOrder}(S, \leq)
\;\land\;
\forall a, b \in S,\;
(a < b) \oplus (a = b) \oplus (b < a),
\]
where $\oplus$ denotes exclusive or.  Equivalently, comparability suffices:
$\forall a,b \in S,\; a \leq b \lor b \leq a$.

