support_blocks.body_tex:
\textbf{Properties of Inverses.}
When $A$ and $B$ are invertible $n \times n$ matrices:
\begin{enumerate}
  \item $(A^{-1})^{-1} = A$
  \item $(AB)^{-1} = B^{-1}A^{-1}$ \quad (order reverses)
  \item $(A^T)^{-1} = (A^{-1})^T$
  \item $(cA)^{-1} = \tfrac{1}{c} A^{-1}$ for $c \neq 0$
\end{enumerate}

